# Disaster-recovery backup of cottage gallery originals.
#
# Each file here corresponds 1:1 to a row in the `gallery_images` Supabase
# table via the `original_filename` column. If Supabase Storage is ever lost,
# `scripts/restore-gallery-from-originals.mjs` re-uploads everything in this
# directory and regenerates the full + thumb variants.
#
# Add new originals here when seeding the gallery; admin uploads after the
# initial seed don't auto-mirror back here (would need a GitHub PAT). For
# long-term mirroring, run `scripts/sync-originals-from-supabase.mjs`
# (planned, not yet built).
